@Evan
Curiously, a couple of posters have said they didn't  know AMBIT. 'Ambit' is no EPEE. It's a word frequently seen in the wild to refer to the range or area of responsibility or applicability of something or someone. 
E.g., a solicitor's ambit used to differ completely from that of a barrister. State convictions are outside the ambit of presidential pardons in the US.

